<speak>Hello, Rachel. I'm in my office with the door closed. My <sub alias="en ar eye see">NRIC</sub> is <sub alias="ess">S</sub> seven five one one six two seven <sub alias="ar">R</sub>. My date of birth is 9 July 1988. The holding I want you to transact in is Nova Technology Equity Fund. Please use <sub alias="you ess">US</sub> dollars for the transaction. Sorry, I meant Singapore dollars for this transaction; I used the other denomination out of habit.</speak>